{"overview":"در اواسط قرن بیست و یکم، مافیاهای توکیو می‌توانند به شیاطین دمونی تقویت‌شده با اتر تبدیل شوند و شجاعان به دنبال آن‌ها می‌دوند. یاشیرو، جان‌ساز، با ناامیدی شاگرد جدیدی به نام آکی جُگامینِه، دختر دبیرستانی که در حال آموزش برای تبدیل شدن به شجاع است، می‌پذیرد. او به زودی درگیر پرونده‌های مشکل‌ساز می‌شود. داستان ماورایی یک استاد بدجنس و شاگرد خودخوانده‌اش آغاز می‌شود!","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the mid-21st century, Tokyo's mafia can turn into ether-enhanced Demon Lords, and Braves hunt them down. Yashiro, the Grim Reaper, reluctantly takes a new apprentice named Aki Jogamine, a high school girl training to become a Brave. He soon finds himself dragged into one troublesome case after another. The supernatural story of a scumbag master and his self-proclaimed apprentice begins!","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2026,"poster":"/zUdByBz1zWn4Prgw5nkVmgfFzfI.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"ریوتا سوزوکی","role":"Yashiro (voice)","photo":"/4Xq18mQttuW2yfRCflnWoU7UqQ5.jpg","en":"Ryota Suzuki"},{"name":"鬼頭明里","role":"Aki Jougamine (voice)","photo":"/AoRQOZRC0yINB0WeKnM569rV1wF.jpg","en":"Akari Kito"},{"name":"春海百乃","role":"Yukine Indou (voice)","photo":"/1tr2x8WEaSRGa8E0MoqVyXgxDD4.jpg","en":"Momo Harumi"},{"name":"花守ゆみり","role":"Sara Kashiwagi Pendragon (voice)","photo":"/zXVwGxsxwEvL1f6wxzTYtxytjDn.jpg","en":"Yumiri Hanamori"},{"name":"田所陽向","role":"Salt Joe (voice)","photo":"/sLgk7ah48Iu491ZFFFzI0uKcsPL.jpg","en":"Hinata Tadokoro"},{"name":"平川大輔","role":"Ongakuya Ishino (voice)","photo":"/8uDi5NxFdxFvfVyo4n5CeOSLWEf.jpg","en":"Daisuke Hirakawa"},{"name":"高戸靖広","role":"Maruta (voice)","photo":"/njJHBtfhUYfhNpJeCh7wEsHaAiT.jpg","en":"Yasuhiro Takato"}],"trailer":"CMgUAW5InbU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/284432/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Ama